Path of Hero's source code is public, but Path of Hero is not open source software. The official builds are free or
pay-what-you-want. Anyone may build Path of Hero from this repository and use what they build for free, but may not
give that build, or the source, to anyone else.

"The Software" means the source code in this repository and anything built from it, changed or not. "The Licensor"
means Trias BYM. "Official builds" means builds of the Software that the Licensor publishes, on itch.io
(https://triasbrata.itch.io/path-of-hero) or on any other channel the Licensor names.

**1. Official builds** Official builds are free, or offered for a donation or a price that the player chooses. You
may use an official build on the terms of the channel you got it from, including any donation or price that channel
asks for.

**2. Building it yourself** You may download, read, compile and change the source code, and use what you build, free
of charge and for any purpose, including your work, on devices you use yourself.

**3. Contributions** You may change the source code to propose a contribution to the Licensor, for example as a pull
request. By submitting a contribution you confirm that you have the right to submit it, and you grant the Licensor a
perpetual, worldwide, irrevocable, royalty-free licence to use, copy, change, sublicense and distribute it under any
terms, including in official builds that are sold.

**4. What you may not do** Except as sections 1 to 3 allow, you may not:
a. distribute the Software to anyone, as source code or as a build, changed or not, free or paid, including through
